SCOPE

The MIT terms above cover the CODE in this repository: the orchestrator
notebook, its builder, and everything under pipeline/.

They do NOT cover the corpus in data/. That material is redistributed under
Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (CC-BY-3.0) and carries its own attribution
requirement. See data/iracing/README.md, data/iracing/attribution.csv, and
data/iracing/LICENSE_RATIONALE.md. Every sentence in data/iracing/sentences.jsonl
records its source video, channel, upload date and licence identifier, so the
attribution obligation travels with the data.

The Formula 1 corpora analysed in the associated paper are broadcast-copyright
and are NOT part of this repository under any licence.
